<title>USA: Leviathan sets two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>Leviathan sets two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leviathan Gas Pipeline Partners LP said on Monday its board of directors approved a two-for-one split of the limited partnership preference and common units.</p>
<p>The company said the record date was December 31 and it would mail the certificates on January 15.</p>
<p>Leviathan said the company was well-positioned for continued growth, and the split would make its units more affordable.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
